\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O saviour, I have nought to plead,
\par In earth beneath or heaven above,
\par But just my own exceeding need,
\par And Thy exceeding love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The need will soon be past and gone,
\par Exceeding great, but quickly o'er;
\par The love unbought is all Thine own,
\par And lasts for evermore.
\par  
\par  
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

